msgid ""
"<p><b><a href='http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exif'>EXIF</a></b> - a standard "
"used by most digital cameras today to store technical information (like "
"aperture and shutter speed) about an image.</p><p><b><a href='http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/IPTC'>IPTC</a></b> - an older standard used in digital "
"photography to store photographer information in an image.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>EXIF</b> छवि फाइलमा मेटाडाटाको रूपमा फोटोका बारेमा प्राविधिक सूचना भण्डारण "
